00:11:38.400 --> 00:11:42.630
You also need paraffin, the waxy stuff that gives crayons their texture.

00:11:45.070 --> 00:11:48.160
Paraffin is poured into a cauldron and melted down.

00:11:55.380 --> 00:11:56.920
Then it's mixed with the red pigment.

00:12:04.190 --> 00:12:10.320
