00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:13.340
I make crayons on a flatbed mold machine.

00:12:14.280 --> 00:12:17.100
In one day, in eight hours, we make about 92,000 crayons.

00:12:19.650 --> 00:12:24.130
Those holes are filling with hot wax that will cool and make perfect crayons.

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:39.380
