00:17:31.790 --> 00:17:35.350
Sometimes, knowing the exact number of things is important.

00:17:35.860 --> 00:17:40.340
For example, you'll definitely want all 96 colors in your new box of crayons.

00:17:40.790 --> 00:17:44.020
But there are times when knowing the exact number isn't crucial.

00:17:44.480 --> 00:17:47.840
And those are the times when knowing how to estimate comes in handy.

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:51.710
You may not know it, but you estimate all the time.

00:17:55.410 --> 00:17:58.550
About how much time do you need to get ready for school in the morning?

00:18:00.830 --> 00:18:06.910
Approximately, how many peanut butter and jelly sandwiches will fill you up at lunch?

00:18:11.770 --> 00:18:15.990
Roughly, how many pizzas will you need to feed the class for your birthday party?

00:18:20.710 --> 00:18:23.090
Estimating comes in handy for professionals, too.

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:27.280
Take, for example, the people in charge of a huge football stadium.

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:29.690
How do they feed and take care of...

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:34.750
of hungry and thirsty football fans well here are some folks who know the drill

00:18:35.030 --> 00:18:45.500
let's go Giants stadium in East Rutherford New Jersey can hold over 77,000

00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:50.800
people but not every game brings in the same number of cheering fans sometimes

00:18:50.800 --> 00:18:58.380
there are only 50 or 60 or 70,000 the stadium officials never really know the

00:18:58.380 --> 00:18:59.900
exact number of people that

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:16.020
show up to a particular game they have to estimate. Here's how they do it. First they

00:19:16.020 --> 00:19:23.660
factor in the weather. Then how well the team is playing and finally they look at last

00:19:23.660 --> 00:19:29.970
year's weekly attendance. This helps them predict how many

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:39.140
people to expect on game day. Every game, tickets are carefully collected.

00:19:45.440 --> 00:19:50.480
The ticket boxes are brought beneath the stadium to the ticket counting room, where

00:19:50.480 --> 00:19:57.110
all the tickets are counted out by hand. When all the ticket stubs are counted,

00:19:57.330 --> 00:19:59.890
stadium officials know the exact number of people

00:20:00.120 --> 00:20:08.980
attending the game last year's records help them predict how many people to expect today this helps

00:20:08.980 --> 00:20:17.630
the food managers figure out how much mustard soda and how many hot dogs they'll need to feed today's

00:20:17.630 --> 00:20:29.280
crowd it's freezing out here today and experienced vendors know what they'll need to defrost those ice

00:20:29.280 --> 00:20:29.680
cold

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:38.320
football fans. When it's really cold outside, we sell a lot of hot chocolate, we sell a

00:20:38.320 --> 00:20:49.100
lot of coffee, and we sell a lot of hot dogs per game. If it's cold, we could sell about

00:20:49.100 --> 00:20:56.680
a thousand cups of hot chocolate a game. This is only one of more than 40 food stands in

00:20:56.680 --> 00:20:59.920
the stadium. They can count on selling approximately $4.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:14.940
thousand hot chocolates today. What do people eat on warmer days? Pretzels. If

00:21:14.940 --> 00:21:22.870
the weather is warm we sell approximately 500 pretzels. 500 pretzels

00:21:22.870 --> 00:21:29.140
times 40 food stands that's 20,000 pretzels in one day. We deliver anywhere

00:21:29.140 --> 00:21:29.800
We're from 16.

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:36.660
thousand to twenty thousand pretzels a week to this stadium. I estimate I

00:21:36.660 --> 00:21:39.680
delivered almost a million pretzels since I've been working for the company.

00:21:40.060 --> 00:21:48.480
Wow, that's a lot of pretzels. Last but not least, the bathroom. How much paper

00:21:48.480 --> 00:21:53.620
does it take to accommodate thousands of people? At Giant Stadium there are 72

00:21:53.620 --> 00:21:58.940
